WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:01.944
- [Kaylan] Come on, we're so close.

00:00:01.944 --> 00:00:03.407
All we need to do is to decide

00:00:03.407 --> 00:00:05.216
how we're going to end the pitch.

00:00:05.216 --> 00:00:07.045
- I say we end with a simple pie chart.

00:00:07.045 --> 00:00:08.425
Numbers and statistics demonstrate

00:00:08.425 --> 00:00:09.442
that we mean business.

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:11.737
- Or, we come up with
a really catchy slogan

00:00:11.737 --> 00:00:14.256
and slap it over some awesome clipart.

00:00:14.256 --> 00:00:16.718
- Elliot, what do you think?

00:00:22.078 --> 00:00:23.621
- Is it hot in here?

00:00:23.621 --> 00:00:26.038
- Elliot, you want to go home, right?

00:00:26.038 --> 00:00:29.452
- Not really, me and my cat
are in a fight right now, so...

00:00:29.452 --> 00:00:32.051
- Right, but you want me to go home.

00:00:32.051 --> 00:00:32.986
- Yeah, sure.

00:00:32.986 --> 00:00:35.079
- Okay, so vote for my way,

00:00:35.079 --> 00:00:37.354
The Digital High-Five.

00:00:37.354 --> 00:00:39.792
- That's not fair, you're pressuring him.

00:00:39.792 --> 00:00:42.455
- What, madame, I most certainly am not!

00:00:42.455 --> 00:00:44.374
- Is he pressuring you?
- Ummm...

00:00:44.374 --> 00:00:46.131
- Elliot, you can tell me.

00:00:46.131 --> 00:00:47.533
- Well, now you're pressuring him

00:00:47.533 --> 00:00:49.036
to say that I'm pressuring him.

00:00:49.036 --> 00:00:50.256
- I'm, I'm going to go get some water.

00:00:50.256 --> 00:00:51.491
I'm parched.

00:00:52.641 --> 00:00:54.836
- Look, my way is the clear winner.

00:00:54.836 --> 00:00:56.177
We end with cold, hard facts.

00:00:56.177 --> 00:00:57.924
Evidentiary proof that we deliver.

00:00:57.924 --> 00:00:59.468
- Hm, there's a surprise.

00:00:59.468 --> 00:01:02.740
Ayna wants to be cold and emotionless.

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:04.995
- Companies like to know the bottom line.

00:01:04.995 --> 00:01:06.214
- Here's the bottom line.

00:01:06.214 --> 00:01:07.226
- Nice segway.

00:01:07.226 --> 00:01:08.140
- Thanks.

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:09.968
The bottom line is

00:01:09.968 --> 00:01:14.916
companies want to know
that we have their back.

00:01:15.656 --> 00:01:18.434
My way is about heart.

00:01:18.434 --> 00:01:19.796
- [Ayna] With nothing concrete

00:01:19.796 --> 00:01:22.030
and specific to back it up.

00:01:22.030 --> 00:01:24.673
Your way is all based on talk.

00:01:24.673 --> 00:01:25.688
Sound familiar?

00:01:25.688 --> 00:01:29.976
- Elliot, isn't my way the
company you'd want to hire?

00:01:30.706 --> 00:01:32.412
- I, I feel like anything I say-

00:01:32.412 --> 00:01:34.059
- This is business.

00:01:34.059 --> 00:01:35.826
We should end the pitch letting them know

00:01:35.826 --> 00:01:37.554
that we're professionals.

00:01:37.554 --> 00:01:39.037
- I know what you're going to say.

00:01:39.037 --> 00:01:41.272
That this is about compromise.

00:01:41.272 --> 00:01:42.530
- [Ayna] No one was going to say that!

00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:44.846
- Hey, maybe we can call
Charlie and see what he thinks.

00:01:44.846 --> 00:01:47.448
- No, Elliot! This is your moment!

00:01:47.448 --> 00:01:49.094
- Oh, I don't want a moment.

00:01:49.094 --> 00:01:50.596
- Which is it, Elliot?

00:01:50.596 --> 00:01:51.836
Me or Kaylan?

00:01:51.836 --> 00:01:54.696
- [Kaylan] Yeah, Elliot, who's right?

00:01:56.306 --> 00:01:58.707
- What, you guys are both right.

00:01:58.707 --> 00:02:01.978
You both have valid points, and...

00:02:02.908 --> 00:02:04.985
Both smell great, and...

00:02:04.985 --> 00:02:06.793
Both good people, so...

00:02:06.793 --> 00:02:09.008
I'm going to just...

00:02:09.008 --> 00:02:10.230
We're all professionals here so,

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:11.359
I don't know why you have to

00:02:11.359 --> 00:02:13.051
bring me in the middle
of this whole thing...

00:02:13.051 --> 00:02:16.078
I just want to go home
and make up with my cat.

00:02:16.078 --> 00:02:18.820
Mr. Harris is waiting for me right now.

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:21.238
He's probably in bed.

00:02:22.508 --> 00:02:23.758
(bouncy music)

00:02:23.758 --> 00:02:25.668
- So I guess we'll go with mine.

00:02:25.668 --> 00:02:27.659
- Alright, I didn't really
care that much anyway.

00:02:27.659 --> 00:02:28.791
- [Voiceover] A-mark (snap)

00:02:28.791 --> 00:02:32.067
- [Ayna] Woah.
- [Elliot] Oof, brrr.

00:02:32.067 --> 00:02:35.550
It's like beeeeep.
(Ayna laughs)

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:42.505
(film reel scrolling)

